<DESCRIPTION>PRESS RELEASE DATED JULY 11, 2025, "GOLDEN HEAVEN GROUP HOLDINGS LTD. ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FIRST HALF OF FISCAL YEAR 2025"
