<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our revenue is derived from sales of in-park
recreation and rental income. The total revenue decreased by $5,666,352, or 40.99%, from $13,824,313 for the six&nbsp;months ended March&nbsp;31,
2024 to $8,157,961 for the six&nbsp;months ended March&nbsp;31, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our revenue from each of our revenue segments
is summarized as follows:</P>

